# How much silicon is modelled below the oxide matters little: silicon conducts a hundred times better than oxide.
# Reference: the same mesh solved with a sparse direct solver in SciPy. The pipeline compares the response with 10 um of substrate.
title Standard shifter with 2 um of substrate above the sink
grid dx=0.25 dy=0.25
window width=60 ymin=-2 ymax=5
layer si -2 0
layer sio2 0 5
rect si -0.25 0.25 2 2.25
rect tin -1 1 4 4.25
heater h xmin=-1 xmax=1 ymin=4 ymax=4.25 power=0.1
probe wg xmin=-0.25 xmax=0.25 ymin=2 ymax=2.25
expect response wg h 169.570727 1e-7
expect pi_power wg h 24.5718511 1e-7
expect peak 41.2317577 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 6720
